# Cutting a task with its note, pasting it inside a zoomed grocery list, going home, then undoing the paste and the cut puts everything back where it was.
file <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
keys j <C-x>
hide Report
see ▌   - Slides
keys G k k .
see 󰋜 › Home › Groceries
keys j p
see ▌   - Report
see       Draft due Friday
keys gh
see ▌   - Groceries
see         Draft due Friday
saved <<END
Work:
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
		- Report
			Draft due Friday
END
keys z
hide Report
see ▌     - Eggs
keys z
see ▌   - Report
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Report
		Draft due Friday
	- Slides
Home:
	- Laundry
	- Groceries
		- Milk
		- Eggs
END
